     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Neal,<br><br>The issue as you hint is that you can&#39;t install the cairoDevice package. That is a Rattle dependency. So that needs to be solved. What happens when you try<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;carioDevice&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>(p.s., feel free to post this on Stack Overflow - it may get some R on Windows or RStudio expert attention.)<br><br>Regards,<br>Graham</div>"
    ],
